//               options: translations of several duas)
//   askWhen  -> "When would you say: <translation>?" (options: scenarioShort)
//
// `scenarioShort` must read naturally after "When would you say..." and MUST
// be unique across all duas (it becomes an answer option).
// `translation` must also be unique across all duas so options never collide.
//
// Sources follow the V1 policy: verified numbers where possible, honest
// grading labels, and collection + book name otherwise.

